Package: cardputer-zero-geiger
Version: 0.2.1-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Kasiin <16441774+Kasiin@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pil (>= 10.1)
Description: Geiger counter for the M5Stack Cardputer Zero
 Counts BCM GPIO22 pulse edges and shows CPS, CPM and a live histogram.
 Estimates gamma dose rates with selectable M4011 and J305 tube profiles.
